ID  - arxiv-1205.1453v2
AU  - MORITA∗, Takeshi
TI  - An asymptotic formula of the divergent bilateral basic hypergeometric series
DA  - D:20210921
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/1205.1453
AB  - We show an asymptotic formula of the divergent bilateral basic hypergeometric series 1ψ0(a; −; q, ·) with using the q-Borel-Laplace method. We also give the limit q →1 −0 of our asymptotic formula.
